# item27j/item27k: Banque01 story route. Follows the map's own cutscene flow by player input; there
# are no `set_goal` bridges. Objective 0 "Access the strongroom." must complete through the game's
# own chain (Cine1 teller scene -> Cine15 Jones scene -> `event fin_flash` -> XIIIDispatcher4 ->
# GT_quitterbanque -> XIIIGoalTrigger0), which promotes objective 1, and objective 1 "Escape from
# the bank." completes through Cine11's `playerevent fin_map` -> XIIIGoalTrigger2 (GoalNumber 1)
# -> DoTravel -> Amos01.
#
# item27k fixed the two VM pawn-move blockers (B-1: the adapter kept a mover's base-pose triangles
# in the static soup; B-2: the walker deadlocked on start-penetrating contacts — the engine's
# MoveActor discards hits within the 2-UU back-off behind the start). Measured after the fix (cine
# trace in local/re/item27k/): Cine1 completes its whole chain (movseqb [26][35][40][46],
# `event toto` [59] at t=58.15 -> Porte8 unlocks; the vault movement-gap teleport is gone) and
# Cine15 walks its old blocker `movseqb sp 0.25 w 33 w 34` [20] and continues to action[34]
# "wait player 300" (t=69.1), where Jones stands at (-7885.1,-2647.3,875.0) (pawn-location in the
# cine trace). The wait's measured bytecode (XIDCine CineController2.Interpret case "Player"):
# SetCollisionSize(300, h) then keep waiting while VSize2D(pawn - player) > 300 or
# |pawn.z - player.z| > pawn.CollisionHeight (75) — the player must be near JONES, not near the
# action's Target position info. The t=70 teleport below satisfies it (the player falls to the
# walkway at z=875, ~2 UU from Jones).
#
# Teleport classes used below:
#   - "flow touch": teleport onto a trigger volume the flow depends on; the run delivers the
#     volume's own engine `Touch`, so every touch is the game's own code.
#   - "measured recipe": the D->E re-entry around DetectionVolume1. Banque0's STA_DonneCle tick
#     released `recoit_cle` 0.1 s after the player RE-ENTERED DV1 in every probe that used it, and
#     never while the player sat inside from the start (mechanism unresolved; measured probes 2-5;
#     item27k revisits this below).
#   - "flow spot": a position a cinema's measured `wait player N` needs (near the pawn, not the
#     action's target marker).

# Leave the intro camera (WaitForFirstDisplay).
t=0.50 forward 1
t=1.50 forward 0

# Bank teller scene (Cine1): DetectionVolume1 (Event julien_cine) starts it through the game's own
# Touch. flow touch.
t=3.00 teleport -428 -2312 80

# item27k: `recoit_cle` releases when Banque0.STA_DonneCle.Tick sees
# VSize2D(teller - player) < fDistanceBanquier (300) && XPC.CanSee(teller) (measured bytecode).
# The old "leave DV1 and re-enter" recipe is not the mechanism: a single teleport to spot E
# (-494,-2383,80) — within 300 UU of the teller with a clear eye line — releases it. (The DV1
# touch at t=3 already started the scene; spot E itself is outside DV1 and fires nothing.)
t=11.00 teleport -494 -2383 80      # flow spot: within the teller's fDistanceBanquier + CanSee

# The teller walks to the counter and opens the staff gate (fixed ~24 s of scene actions after
# recoit_cle; her `wait player 500`, action[32], passed with the player here in the probes).
t=23.00 teleport -540 -1350 80      # flow: within the teller's wait-player radius

# Cine1 `event james` (action[45]) starts Cine6 (James); his `wait player 700` (action[4]) needs
# the player this close for the dialogue, then `event ajulien` fires.
t=40.00 teleport -1760 -2480 -80    # flow: within James's wait-player radius

# Vault door Porte8: unlocked by the game itself at t=58.15 (Cine1[59] `event toto`, measured) —
# no movement-gap teleport needed since item27k's B-1 fix.
t=44.00 teleport -2843 -6380 -150   # flow: to the vault door

# Strongroom: DetectionVolume12's Touch starts Cine15 (Jones). flow touch.
t=47.00 teleport -7616 -2784 1456   # flow touch: DetectionVolume12 (starts Cine15)
t=48.00 teleport -7142 -2100 880    # flow spot: Cine15[3] "wait player 300" (Jones at the safe)

# Jones plays the briefcase scene, walks his waypoints (w33/w34 [20], w35/w36/w25/w23 [22], w58
# [27]) and reaches [34] "wait player 300" at t~69.1 (measured), standing at
# (-7885.1,-2647.3,875.0). flow spot: the player falls to the walkway at z=875, ~2 UU from Jones.
t=70.00 teleport -7883 -2648 990

# The scene should run to `event fin_flash` (action[45]) with the player beside Jones; then the
# objective-0 chain (XIIIDispatcher4 -> GT_quitterbanque -> XIIIGoalTrigger0) completes objective 0
# and promotes objective 1. The escape-flow volumes below drive the escape cinemas -> Cine11
# `playerevent fin_map` -> XIIIGoalTrigger2 (GoalNumber 1) -> DoTravel -> Amos01.
t=76.00 teleport 1300.03 -1917.39 1478  # flow touch: TouchTrigger5 (Event vignracaille)
t=79.00 teleport 865 -4075 1530         # flow touch: TouchTrigger2 (Event arrivee_fbi)
t=82.00 teleport 1134 -4222 480         # flow touch: TouchTrigger3 (Event fbi_dial2)
t=85.00 teleport 1148 -4063 380         # flow touch: TouchTrigger4 (Event arrivee_amos)
t=88.00 teleport 1014.38 -4309 620      # flow touch: TouchTrigger10 (Event CarOut)

# Wait for the game's own travel (Amos01 via the end-of-level chain).
t=91.00 wait_travel
